BEARS: Are expected to play again without top outside cornerback Jaylon Johnson and safety Eddie Jackson. Not that those two absences led to a bonanza from Broncos receivers; Russell Wilson spread the ball around. But if McLaurin remains the target leader then he'll have the best shot at a big game. Rookies Tyrique Stevenson and Terell Smith figure to line up across from McLaurin the most.","entities":["NFL","Russell Wilson","NFL Fantasy Football Week 5 Lineup Decisions: Starts, Sits, Sleepers, Busts to know for every game","Sam Howell","McLaurin","Eddie Jackson","Terell Smith","Week 4 game","CBSSports.com","Jaylon Johnson","fantasy football","Commanders","Broncos","Tyrique Stevenson","Bears"],"facts":["Brock Purdy -MENTIONS-> NFL","Raiders vs. Lions live score, updates, highlights from NFL 'Monday Night Football' game -MENTIONS-> NFL","Fans spot Travis Kelce wearing Taylor Swift-themed friendship bracelet before she attended his game -MENTIONS-> NFL","Chiefs vs. Packers live score, updates, highlights from NFL 'Sunday Night Football' game -MENTIONS-> NFL","Christmas Day preview: 49ers, Ravens square off in potential Super Bowl sneak peek -MENTIONS-> NFL"]}

